# Suyou, Mask of the Immortal

> Suyou is not a blind-pick assassin. He is a tempo jungler who turns one bad rotation into a dead backliner, then looks ordinary when draft asks him to front-to-back through peel, crowd control, and layered magic damage. Pick him for fast river fights and side-angle entries, not for slow siege.

