## Curated builds

Reviewed against patch 2.1.67 on 2026-05-13. The live patch is 2.2.16a, so these have not been re-read against it yet.

### Jungle Bruiser Default (Jungle)

- Items: Tough Boots, Hunter Strike, War Axe, Queen's Wings, Blade of Despair, Malefic Roar
- Core: Hunter Strike, War Axe, Queen's Wings
- Emblem: Assassin Emblem with Rupture, Seasoned Hunter, Killing Spree
- Battle spell: Retribution
- Blessing: Ice Retribution
- Flex: Warrior Boots over Tough Boots when Use when the first two jungle fights are mostly physical damage and enemy control does not punish hold-cast entries.; Brute Force Breastplate over Blade of Despair when Use when Suyou must take repeated front-line contact before reaching the marksman or mage.; Immortality over Malefic Roar when Use for final Lord fights when a revive matters more than one last armor-piercing damage slot.; Sea Halberd over Malefic Roar when Use against high-HP sustain targets before they stack enough Physical Defense to demand Malefic Roar.
- Total cost: 12130 gold

Default jungle setup for games where Suyou needs Hunter Strike chase tempo, War Axe stacking, and Queen's Wings to survive the second skill cycle.

### Jungle Snowball Execute (Jungle)

- Items: Tough Boots, Hunter Strike, Sky Piercer, War Axe, Malefic Roar, Queen's Wings
- Core: Hunter Strike, Sky Piercer, War Axe
- Emblem: Assassin Emblem with Rupture, Seasoned Hunter, Lethal Ignition
- Battle spell: Retribution
- Blessing: Flame Retribution
- Flex: Blade of Despair over Queen's Wings when Use only when Suyou is ahead enough to protect Sky Piercer stacks and end fights before return damage lands.; Rose Gold Meteor over Queen's Wings when Use against magic burst when the Lifeline shield and movement burst protect the first dive better than Demonize.; Immortality over Queen's Wings when Use after Sky Piercer stacks become a shutdown risk and one revive can preserve objective tempo.
- Total cost: 10620 gold

High-tempo jungle setup for early-kill drafts where Flame Retribution and Sky Piercer turn Suyou's first clean pick into Turtle control.

### EXP Sustain Frontline (EXP)

