- Core: War Axe, Hunter Strike, Queen's Wings
- Emblem: Fighter Emblem with Firmness, Festival of Blood, Brave Smite
- Battle spell: Vengeance
- Flex: Warrior Boots over Tough Boots when Use into physical EXP lanes when shorter control chains make Fortitude less valuable.; Oracle over Brute Force Breastplate when Use when Suyou needs stronger Soul Sever healing and the main threat is mixed or magic damage.; Dominance Ice over Brute Force Breastplate when Use when enemy shield, HP regen, or attack-speed carries must hit Suyou during the first entry.; Athena's Shield over Immortality when Use against front-loaded magic burst that can remove Suyou before Vengeance and Queen's Wings stabilize the trade.; Malefic Roar over Immortality when Use when the enemy front line stacks Physical Defense and your team already has enough late-fight safety.
- Total cost: 11050 gold

EXP setup for drafts where Suyou has to absorb first contact with Vengeance, then use hold-cast damage reduction and spell vamp to keep fighting.

